Redesign the hydrophone panel, and make it say something

It was a flat row of bars. Now it reads like an audio tool and, more to the
point, it explains the acoustic agent's finding instead of decorating it.

  mirrored waveform about a center line, the way audio is actually drawn
  a real time axis with second ticks, so the trace is anchored to the clip
  a computed peak marker, positioned from core/waveform.py, not by eye
  a live elapsed readout riding the playhead
  a SECOND LANE: the same audio low pass filtered near 500 Hz

THE LOW BAND IS THE POINT. The acoustic agent reported snapping shrimp plus a
vessel engine. Those separate cleanly by frequency: engine noise is
low-frequency rumble, snapping shrimp are broadband transients well above
2 kHz. So a moving-average low pass at roughly a 500 Hz corner, stdlib only,
no numpy, isolates the vessel component. The picture now shows the two things
the agent said it heard.

AND THE HONEST PART, which changed the design. Measured on this clip, the low
band peaks at 4.7 percent of the full band peak, because shrimp dominate the
energy by more than an order of magnitude. On a shared axis it renders as a
flat line: true, and useless. So the API returns BOTH scalings. `low_band`
keeps the honest relative energy, `low_band_self` shows the shape, and the
lane is drawn to its own scale with "SCALED INDEPENDENTLY" printed on the
chart plus the exact 4.7 percent figure in the caption. Nobody should compare
heights across lanes, so the page says so rather than hoping.

The filter is blunt and is labelled as one. No spectrogram is claimed and no
frequency figure is asserted beyond the stated corner.

MY ERROR, recorded: Brian asked what the hydrophone was, a suggestion said to
redesign it, and I argued at length against REMOVING it. Nobody proposed
removal. I answered a position no one held instead of the question asked.

Two failures on the way, both mine and both caught by tests I wrote earlier:
the American English check found "centre" in one of my own code comments, and
the claim test caught the test count going stale again, 94 against 96.

96 tests pass.
